          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<ul><li>Superstar ingredient found in a french volcano. Oléoactif™ is a post-biotic proven to improve your skin barrier. </li><li><strong>Repairs your skin and fortifies your skin barrier to promote overall skin health.</strong></li></ul>",
